WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.682
A privacy watchdog

00:00:01.494 --> 00:00:02.083
says

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:03.298
don't buy AI

00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:04.253
smart glasses

00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:05.713
The Dutch data

00:00:05.525 --> 00:00:06.645
protection authority

00:00:06.457 --> 00:00:07.741
tested six AI

00:00:07.553 --> 00:00:08.661
smart glasses

00:00:08.803 --> 00:00:09.840
priced from under

00:00:09.652 --> 00:00:10.678
one hundred to

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:11.774
over five hundred

00:00:11.586 --> 00:00:12.305
euros

00:00:12.838 --> 00:00:13.852
In a simulated

00:00:13.663 --> 00:00:14.488
emergency

00:00:14.678 --> 00:00:15.974
one pair repeatedly

00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:17.095
claimed an ambulance

00:00:16.918 --> 00:00:17.554
was on its

00:00:17.366 --> 00:00:17.861
way

00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:18.757
though no one

00:00:18.569 --> 00:00:19.512
had been called

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:21.492
Others misread medicine

00:00:21.304 --> 00:00:22.553
instructions and gave

00:00:22.365 --> 00:00:23.473
dating advice about

00:00:23.285 --> 00:00:24.004
a minor

00:00:24.143 --> 00:00:25.475
The watchdog advises

00:00:25.287 --> 00:00:26.336
against buying them

00:00:26.254 --> 00:00:27.314
but stopped short

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:27.892
of a ban

00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:29.436
Full story on

00:00:29.247 --> 00:00:30.143
the dashboard
